0 FILE inverted-nose.ldr
0 Inverted slope hung under a plate to shape a nose or chin
0 Name: inverted-nose.ldr
0 Author: ldraw-nova recipe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 // deck: 2 x 2 plate; the slope hangs from its underside
1 4 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3022.dat
0 STEP
0 // chin: Inverted slope pushed up into the plate's sockets by its four top studs
1 4 0 8 10 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3660b.dat
0 STEP
0 // cap: Tile on top for a smooth nose
1 4 0 -8 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3068b.dat
0 NOFILE
